/-!
# `aes-gcm` specification

Entry point for the specification of the `aes-gcm` crate:

* `AesGcm.Spec.GCM`: AES-GCM as the crate instantiates the shared definitions of NIST SP 800-38D in
  `Standards.NIST.GCM`, on bytes;
* `AesGcm.Spec.Program.Extracted`: the compiled program, generated by `scripts/extract.py`;
* `AesGcm.Spec.Program`: call semantics of each extracted entry point (valid calls, output
  readers, and the memory regions a call may change).

`AesGcm.Statements` may import only specification modules.
-/
